{"schema_version":2,"layout_tree":{"nodeType":"element","tag":"html","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":1200,"height":3696},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"head","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":0,"height":0},"computed":{"display":"none","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n","layout":{"rects":[]}},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"meta","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":0,"height":0},"computed":{"display":"none","textAlign":"start"},"children":[]},{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n","layout":{"rects":[]}},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"title","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":0,"height":0},"computed":{"display":"none","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"Pretext corpus: width 860px","layout":{"rects":[]}}]},{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n","layout":{"rects":[]}},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"style","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":0,"height":0},"computed":{"display":"none","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n@font-face {\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans SC';\n    src: url('../font/NotoSansSC-Subset.otf') format('opentype');\n}\n* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody { font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-kerning: none; text-spacing-trim: space-all; }\n","layout":{"rects":[]}}]},{"nodeType":"text","text":"\n","layout":{"rects":[]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"body","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":1200,"height":3696},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"div","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":860,"height":3696},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我冒了嚴寒，回到相隔二千餘里，別了二十餘年的故鄕去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":0,"width":416,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":24,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"時候既然是深冬；漸近故鄕時，天氣又陰晦了，冷風吹進船艙中，嗚嗚的響，從篷隙向外一望，蒼黃的天底下，遠近橫着","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":24,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"幾個蕭索的荒村，沒有一些活氣。我的心禁不住悲涼起來了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":48,"width":432,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":72,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"阿！這不是我二十年來時時記得的故鄕？","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":72,"width":288,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":96,"width":860,"height":72},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我所記得的故鄕全不如此。我的故鄕好得多了。但要我記起他的美麗，說出他的佳處來，卻又沒有影像，沒有言辭了。彷","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":96,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"彿也就如此。於是我自己解釋說：故鄕本也如此，——雖然沒有進步，也未必有如我所感的悲涼，這只是我自己心情的改","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":120,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"變罷了，因爲我這次回鄕，本沒有什麽好心緖。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":144,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":168,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我這次是專爲了別他而來的。我們多年聚族而居的老屋，已經公同賣給別姓了，交屋的期限，只在本年，所以必須趕在正","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":168,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"月初一以前，永別了熟識的老屋，而且遠離了熟識的故鄕，搬家到我在謀食的異地去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":192,"width":608,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":216,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"第二日淸早晨我到了我家的門口了。瓦楞上許多枯草的斷莖當風抖着，正在說明這老屋難免易主的原因。幾房的本家大約","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":216,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"已經搬走了，所以很寂靜。我到了自家的房外，我的母親早已迎着出來了，接着便飛出了八歲的姪兒宏兒。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":240,"width":752,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":264,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我的母親很高興，但也藏着許多淒涼的神情，教我坐下，歇息，喝茶，且不談搬家的事。宏兒沒有見過我，遠遠的對面站","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":264,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"着只是看。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":288,"width":80,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":312,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"但我們終於談到搬家的事。我說外間的寓所已經租定了，又買了幾件家具，此外須將家裏所有的木器賣去，再去增添。母","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":312,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"親也說好，而且行李也略已齊集，木器不便搬運的，也小半賣去了，只是收不起錢來。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":336,"width":608,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":360,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『你休息一兩天，去拜望親戚本家一回，我們便可以走了。』母親說。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":360,"width":496,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":384,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『是的。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":384,"width":80,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":408,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『還有閏土，他每到我家來時，總問起你，很想見你一回面。我已經將你到家的大約日期通知他，他也許就要來了。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":408,"width":832,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":432,"width":860,"height":72},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"這時候，我的腦裏忽然閃出一幅神異的圖畫來：深藍的天空中掛着一輪金黃的圓月，下面是海邊的沙地，都種着一望無際","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":432,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"的碧綠的西瓜，其間有一個十一二歲的少年，項帶銀圈，手揑一柄鋼叉，向一匹猹儘力的刺去，那猹卻將身一扭，反從他","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":456,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"的胯下逃走了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":480,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":504,"width":860,"height":120},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"這少年便是閏土。我認識他時，也不過十多歲，離現在將有三十年了；那時我的父親還在世，家景也好，我正是一個少","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":504,"width":832,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"爺。那一年，我家是一件大祭祀的値年。這祭祀，說是三十多年纔能輪到一回，所以很鄭重；正月裏供祖像，供品很多，","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":528,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"祭器很講究，拜的人也很多，祭器也很要防偸去。我家只有一個忙月（我們這里給人做工的分三種：整年給一定人家做工","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":552,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"的叫長年；按日給人做工的叫短工；自己也種地，只在過年過節以及收租時候來給一定的人家做工的稱忙月），忙不過","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":576,"width":832,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"來，他便對父親說，可以叫他的兒子閏土來管祭器的。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":600,"width":384,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":624,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我的父親允許了；我也很高興，因爲我早聽到閏土這名字，而且知道他和我彷彿年紀，閏月生的，五行缺土，所以他的父","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":624,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"親叫他閏土。他是能裝弶捉小鳥雀的。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":648,"width":272,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":672,"width":860,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我於是日日盼望新年，新年到，閏土也就到了。好容易到了年末，有一日，母親告訴我，閏土來了，我便飛跑的去看。他","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":672,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"正在廚房裏，紫色的圓臉，頭戴一頂小氈帽，頸上套一個明晃晃的銀項圈，這可見他的父親十分愛他，怕他死去，所以在","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":696,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"神佛面前許下願心，用圈子將他套住了。他見人很怕羞，只是不怕我，沒有旁人的時候，便和我說話，於是不到半日，我","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":720,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"們便熟識了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":744,"width":96,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":768,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我們那時候不知道談些什麽，只記得閏土很高興，說是上城之後，見了許多沒有見過的東西。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":768,"width":656,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":792,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"第二日，我便要他捕鳥。他說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":792,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":816,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『這不能。須大雪下了纔好。我們沙地上，下了雪，我掃出一塊空地來，用短棒支起一個大竹匾，撒下粃穀，看鳥雀來喫","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":816,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"時，我遠遠地將縛在棒上的繩子只一拉，那鳥雀就罩在竹匾下了。什麽都有：稻雞、角雞、鵓鴣、藍背……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":840,"width":768,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":864,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我於是又很盼望下雪。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":864,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":888,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"閏土又對我說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":888,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":912,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『現在太冷，你夏天到我們這里來。我們日裏到海邊檢貝殼去，紅的綠的都有，鬼見怕也有，觀音手也有，晚上我和爹管","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":912,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"西瓜去，你也去。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":936,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":960,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『管賊麽？』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":960,"width":96,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":984,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『不是。走路的人口渴了摘一個瓜喫，我們這里是不算偸的。要管的是獾豬、刺蝟、猹。月亮地下，你聽，啦啦的響了，","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":984,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"猹在咬瓜了。你便揑了胡叉，輕輕地走去……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1008,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1032,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我那時並不知道這所謂猹的是怎麽一件東西——便是現在也沒有知道——只是無端的覺得狀如小狗而很凶猛。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1032,"width":768,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1056,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『他不咬人麽？』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1056,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1080,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『有胡叉呢。走到了，看見猹了，你便刺。這畜生很伶俐，倒向你奔來，反從胯下竄了。他的皮毛是油一般的滑。……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1080,"width":848,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1104,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我素不知道天下有這許多新鮮事：海邊有如許五色的貝殼；西瓜有這樣危險的經歷，我先前單知道他在水果店裏出賣罷","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1104,"width":832,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1128,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1152,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『我們沙地裏，潮汛要來的時候，就有許多跳魚兒只是跳，都有靑蛙似的兩個脚。……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1152,"width":624,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1176,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"阿！閏土的心裏有無窮無盡的希奇的事，都是我往常的朋友所不知道的。他們不知道一些事，閏土在海邊時，他們都和我","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1176,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"一樣只看見院子裏高牆上的四角的天空。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1200,"width":288,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1224,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"可惜正月過去了，閏土須回家裏去，我急得大哭，他也躱到廚房裏，哭着不肯出門，但終於被他父親帶走了。他後來還託","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1224,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"他的父親帶給我一包貝殼和幾枝很好看的鳥毛，我也曾送他一兩次東西，但從此沒有再見面。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1248,"width":656,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1272,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"現在我的母親提起了他，我這兒時的記憶，忽而全都閃電似的蘇生過來，似乎看到了我的美麗的故鄕了。我應聲說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1272,"width":816,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1296,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『這好極！他，——怎樣？……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1296,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1320,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『他？……他景況也很不如意……』母親說着，便向房外看，『這些人又來了。說是買木器，順手也就隨便拿走的，我得","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1320,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"去看看。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1344,"width":80,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1368,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"母親站起身，出去了。門外有幾個女人的聲音，我便招宏兒走近面前，和他閒話：問他可會寫字，可願意出門。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1368,"width":784,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1392,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『我們坐火車去麽？』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1392,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1416,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『我們坐火車去。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1416,"width":144,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1440,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『船呢？』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1440,"width":80,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1464,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『先坐船，……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1464,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1488,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『哈！這模樣了！鬍子這麽長了！』一種尖利的怪聲突然大叫起來。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1488,"width":480,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1512,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我喫了一嚇，趕忙擡起頭，卻見一個凸顴骨，薄嘴唇，五十歲上下的女人站在我面前，兩手搭在髀間，沒有繫裙，張着兩","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1512,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"脚，正像一個畫圖儀器裏細脚伶仃的圓規。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1536,"width":304,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1560,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我愕然了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1560,"width":80,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1584,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『不認識了麽？我還抱你咧！』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1584,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1608,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我愈加愕然了。幸而我的母親也就進來，從旁說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1608,"width":352,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1632,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『他多年出門，統忘卻了。你該記得罷，』便向着我說，『這是斜對門的楊二嫂，……開豆腐店的。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1632,"width":720,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1656,"width":860,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"哦，我記得了。我孩子時候，在斜對門的豆腐店裏確乎終日坐着一個楊二嫂，人都叫伊『豆腐西施』。但是擦着白粉，顴","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1656,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"骨沒有這麽高，嘴脣也沒有這麽薄。而且終日坐着，我也從沒有見過這圓規式的姿勢。那時人說：因爲伊，這豆腐店的買","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1680,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"賣非常好。但這大約因爲年齡的關係，我卻並未蒙着一毫感化，所以竟完全忘卻了。然而圓規很不平，顯出鄙夷的神色，","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1704,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"彷彿嗤笑法國人不知道拿破崙，美國人不知道華盛頓似的，冷笑說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1728,"width":480,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1752,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『忘了？這眞是貴人眼高。……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1752,"width":240,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1776,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『那有這事……我……』我惶恐着，站起來說。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1776,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1800,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『那麽，我對你說。迅哥兒，你闊了，搬動又笨重，你還要什麽這些破爛木器，讓我拿去罷。我們小戶人家，用得着。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1800,"width":848,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1824,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『我並沒有闊哩。我須賣了這些，再去……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1824,"width":320,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1848,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『阿呀呀，你放了道台了，還說不闊？你現在有三房姨太太；出門便是八擡的大轎，還說不闊？嚇，什麽都瞞不過我。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1848,"width":848,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1872,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我知道無話可說了，便閉了口，默默的站着。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1872,"width":320,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1896,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『阿呀阿呀，眞是愈有錢，便愈是一毫不肯放鬆，愈是一毫不肯放鬆，便愈有錢……』圓規一面憤憤的回轉身，一面絮絮","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1896,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"的說，慢慢向外走，順便將我母親的一副手套塞在褲腰裏，出去了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1920,"width":480,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1944,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"此後又有近處的本家和親戚來訪問我。我一面應酬，偸空便收拾些行李，這樣的過了三四天。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1944,"width":656,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":1968,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"一日是天氣很冷的午後，我喫過午飯，坐着喝茶，覺得外面有人進來了，便回頭去看。我看時，不由的非常出驚，慌忙站","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1968,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"起身，迎着走去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":1992,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2016,"width":860,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"這來的便是閏土。雖然我一見便知道是閏土，但又不是我這記憶上的閏土了。他身材增加了一倍；先前的紫色的圓臉，已","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2016,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"經變作灰黃，而且加上了很深的皺紋；眼睛也像他父親一樣，周圍都腫得通紅，這我知道，在海邊種地的人，終日吹着海","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2040,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"風，大抵是這樣的。他頭上是一頂破氈帽，身上只一件極薄的棉衣，渾身瑟索着；手裏提着一個紙包和一枝長煙管，那手","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2064,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"也不是我所記得的紅活圓實的手，卻又粗又笨而且開裂，像是松樹皮了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2088,"width":512,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2112,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我這時很興奮，但不知道怎麽說纔好，只是說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2112,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2136,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『阿！閏土哥，——你來了？……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2136,"width":256,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我接着便有許多話，想要連珠一般湧出：角雞、跳魚兒、貝殼、猹，……但又總覺得被什麽擋着似的。單在腦裏面回旋，","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2160,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"吐不出口外去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2184,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2208,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"他站住了，臉上現出歡喜和淒涼的神情；動着嘴脣，卻沒有作聲。他的態度終於恭敬起來了，分明的叫道：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2208,"width":752,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『老爺！……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2232,"width":112,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2256,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我似乎打了一個寒噤；我就知道，我們之間已經隔了一層可悲的厚障壁了。我也說不出話。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2256,"width":640,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2280,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"他回過頭去說：『水生，給老爺磕頭。』便拖出躱在背後的孩子來，這正是一個二十年前的閏土，只是黃瘦些，頸子上沒","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2280,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"有銀圈罷了。『這是第五個孩子，沒有見過世面，躱躱閃閃。……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2304,"width":480,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"母親和宏兒下樓來了，他們大約也聽到了聲音。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2328,"width":336,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2352,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『老太太。信是早收到了。我實在喜歡的了不得，知道老爺回來……』閏土說。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2352,"width":560,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『阿，你怎的這樣客氣起來。你們先前不是哥弟稱呼麽？還是照舊：迅哥兒。』母親高興的說。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2376,"width":672,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『阿呀，老太太眞是……這成什麽規矩。那時是孩子，不懂事……』閏土說着，又叫水生上來打拱，那孩子卻害羞，緊緊","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2400,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"的只貼在他背後。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2424,"width":128,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2448,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『他就是水生？第五個？都是生人，怕生也難怪的；還是宏兒和他去走走。』母親說。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2448,"width":608,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2472,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"宏兒聽得這話，便來招水生，水生卻鬆鬆爽爽同他一路出去了。母親叫閏土坐，他遲疑了一回，終於就了坐，將長煙管靠","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2472,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"在桌旁，遞過紙包來，說：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2496,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2520,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『冬天沒有什麽東西了。這一點乾靑豆倒是自家曬在那里的，請老爺……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2520,"width":528,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2544,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我問問他的景況。他只是搖頭。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2544,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2568,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『非常難。第六個孩子也會幫忙了，卻總是喫不够……又不太平……什麽地方都要錢，沒有定規……收成又壞。種出東西","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2568,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"來，挑去賣，總要捐幾回錢，折了本；不去賣，又只能爛掉。……』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2592,"width":480,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"他只是搖頭；臉上雖然刻着許多皺紋，卻全然不動，彷彿石像一般。他大約只是覺得苦，卻又形容不出，沈默了片時，便","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2616,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"拿起煙管來默默的吸煙了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2640,"width":192,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2664,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"母親問他，知道他的家裏事務忙，明天便得回去；又沒有喫過午飯，便叫他自己到廚下炒飯喫去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2664,"width":688,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2688,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"他出去了；母親和我都歎息他的景況：多子、饑荒、苛稅、兵、匪、官、紳，都苦得他像一個木偶人了。母親對我說，凡","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2688,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"是不必搬走的東西，儘可以送他，可以聽他自己去揀擇。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2712,"width":400,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2736,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"下午，他揀好了幾件東西：兩條長桌，四個椅子，一副香爐和燭臺，一桿擡秤。他又要所有的草灰（我們這裏煑飯是燒稻","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2736,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"草的，那灰，可以做沙地的肥料），待我們啓程的時候，他用船來載去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2760,"width":512,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2784,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"夜間，我們又談些閒天，都是無關緊要的話；第二天早晨，他就領了水生回去了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2784,"width":576,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":860,"height":72},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"又過了九日，是我們啓程的日期。閏土早晨便到了，水生沒有同來，卻只帶着一個五歲的女兒管船隻。我們終日很忙碌，","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2808,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"再沒有談天的工夫。來客也不少，有送行的，有拿東西的，有送行兼拿東西的。待到傍晚我們上船的時候，這老屋裏的所","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2832,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"有破舊大小粗細東西，已經一掃而空了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2856,"width":288,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我們的船向前走，兩岸的靑山在黃昏中，都裝成了深黛顏色，連着退向船後梢去。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2880,"width":576,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2904,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"宏兒和我靠着船窗，同看外面模糊的風景，他忽然問道：","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2904,"width":400,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2928,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『大伯！我們甚麽時候回來？』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2928,"width":224,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『回來？你怎麽還沒有走就想回來了。』","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2952,"width":288,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":2976,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"『可是，水生約我到他家玩去咧……』他睜着大的黑眼睛，癡癡的想。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":2976,"width":496,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3000,"width":860,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我和母親也都有些惘然，於是又提起閏土來。母親說：那豆腐西施的楊二嫂，自從我家收拾行李以來，本是每日必到的，","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3000,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"前天伊在灰堆裏，掏出十多個碗碟來，議論之後，便定說是閏土埋着的，他可以在運灰的時候，一齊搬回家裏去；楊二嫂","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3024,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"發見了這件事，自己很以爲功，便拿了那狗氣殺（這是我們這裏養雞的器具，木盤上面有着柵欄，內盛食料，雞可以伸進","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3048,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"頸子去啄，狗卻不能，只能看着氣死），飛也似的跑了，虧伊裝着這麽高底的小脚，竟跑得這樣快。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3072,"width":704,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3096,"width":860,"height":72},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"老屋離我愈遠了；故鄕的山水也都漸漸遠離了我，但我卻並不感到怎樣的留戀。我只覺得我四面有看不見的高牆，將我隔","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3096,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"成孤身，使我非常氣悶；那西瓜地上的銀項圈的小英雄的影象，我本來十分淸楚，現在卻忽地模糊了，又使我非常的悲","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3120,"width":832,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"哀。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3144,"width":32,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3168,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"母親和宏兒都睡着了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3168,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3192,"width":860,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我躺着，聽船底潺潺的水聲，知道我在走我的路，我想：我竟與閏土隔絕到這地步了，但我們的後輩還是一氣，宏兒不是","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3192,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"正在想念水生麽。我希望他們不再像我，又大家隔膜起來……然而我又不願意他們因爲要一氣，都如我的辛苦展轉而生","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3216,"width":832,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"活，也不願意他們都如閏土的辛苦麻木而生活，也不願意都如別人的辛苦恣睢而生活。他們應該有新的生活，爲我們所未","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3240,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"經生活過的。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3264,"width":96,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3288,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我想到希望，忽然害怕起來了。閏土要香爐和燭臺的時候，我還暗地裏笑他，以爲他總是崇拜偶像，什麽時候都不忘卻。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3288,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"現在我所謂希望，不也是我自己手製的偶像麽？只是他的願望切近，我的願望茫遠罷了。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3312,"width":624,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3336,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"我在朦朧中，眼前展開一片海邊碧綠的沙地來，上面深藍的天空中掛着一輪金黃的圓月。我想：希望是本無所謂有，無所","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3336,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"謂無的。這正如地上的路，其實地上本沒有路；走的人多了，也便成了路。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3360,"width":528,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3384,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"（一九二一年一月。）","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3384,"width":160,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3408,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"1996年1月1日，这部作品在原著作國家或地區屬於公有領域，之前在美國從未出版，其作者1936年逝世，在美國以及版權","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3408,"width":856.81,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"期限是作者終身加80年以下的國家以及地区，屬於公有領域。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3432,"width":433.77,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3456,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"这部作品也可能在本國本地版權期限更長，但對外國外地作品應用較短期限規則的國家以及地区，屬於公有領域。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3456,"width":800,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3480,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"Public domainPublic domainfalsefalse","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3480,"width":286.25,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3504,"width":860,"height":96},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"本作品現時在大中華兩岸地區因著作权保护条款过期而处于公有领域。根据《中华人民共和国著作权法》第二十一条第二","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3504,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"款（司法管辖区为中国大陆，不包括香港和澳门）和中华民国的《著作权法》第三十三條（目前司法管辖区为台澎金马地","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3528,"width":848,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"区），所有著作权持有者为法人的作品，在首次发表50年后，或者从创作之日起50年未发表，即进入公有领域。其他适用","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3552,"width":851.53,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"作品则在作者死亡后50年进入公有领域。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3576,"width":289.77,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":860,"height":48},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"据《中华人民共和国著作权法释义》，法人作品应满足三点要求：（1）由法人（或其他组织，以下简称“法人”）主持创","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3600,"width":856.89,"height":24}]}},{"nodeType":"text","text":"作，而非工作人员自发进行；（2）创作思想及表达方式体现法人意志；（3）由法人负责，而非执笔者。（详情）","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3624,"width":801.77,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3648,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"鲁迅《故鄉》最初发表于1921年5月1日《新青年》第九卷第一號。《鲁迅全集》由鲁迅先生纪念委员会编印于1938年。","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3648,"width":840.81,"height":24}]}}]},{"nodeType":"element","tag":"p","layout":{"x":0,"y":3672,"width":860,"height":24},"computed":{"display":"block","textAlign":"start"},"children":[{"nodeType":"text","text":"Public domainPublic domainfalsefalse","layout":{"rects":[{"x":0,"y":3672,"width":286.25,"height":24}]}}]}]}]}]}}